<div class="tab-content"><br>
<div id="detailsTabContent" class="tab-pane active">

    <dl id="descriptorDetails_AutoimmuneDiseasesoftheNervousSystem"
        class="dl-horizontal">

        <dt>MeSH Heading      </dt>

        <dd>Autoimmune Diseases of the Nervous System</dd>

        
                    <dt>Tree Number(s)</dt>
                    
                        <dd><a id="treeNumber_0" onclick=
                               "switchTab([ 'trees', 'treesTabContent' ])"
                            >C10.114</a></dd>
                    
                        <dd><a id="treeNumber_1" onclick=
                               "switchTab([ 'trees', 'treesTabContent' ])"
                            >C20.111.258</a></dd>
                    

        <dt>Unique ID</dt><dd>D020274</dd>

        <dt>RDF Unique Identifier</dt>
        <dd><a href="https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D020274.html">
            http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D020274
        </a></dd>

        
                <span id="scopeNote">
                    <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>Disorders caused by cellular or humoral immune responses primarily directed towards nervous system autoantigens. The immune response may be directed towards specific tissue components (e.g., myelin) and may be limited to the central nervous system (e.g., <a href="/record/ui?ui=D009103" class="textLink_MULTIPLESCLEROSIS">MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS</a>) or the peripheral nervous system (e.g., <a href="/record/ui?ui=D020275" class="textLink_GUILLAIN-BARRESYNDROME">GUILLAIN-BARRE SYNDROME</a>).</dd>
                </span>
            
            <dt>Entry Version</dt><dd>AUTOIMMUNE DIS NERVOUS SYSTEM</dd>
        
                <dt>Entry Term(s)</dt>
                <dd>
                    Antibody-Mediated Encephalitis
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Autoimmune Diseases, Nervous System
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Autoimmune Diseases, Neurologic
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Autoimmune Disorders of the Nervous System
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Autoimmune Disorders, Nervous System
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Autoimmune Encephalitis
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Autoimmune Nervous System Diseases
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Immune Diseases, Nervous System
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Immune Disorders, Nervous System
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Nervous System Autoimmune Diseases
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Nervous System Immune Diseases
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Nervous System Immune Disorders
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Neurologic Autoimmune Diseases
                    
                </dd>
                <dt>Previous Indexing</dt>
                
